{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/123336","id":4486249969,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABC2a98Q","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123336","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123336.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123336.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123336","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/123336/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/123336/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123336/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/588f16c15b6cc2acc0c867a3d5bf0b37cff83670","number":123336,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"[Docs] Add note to `Input.mouse_mode` on capturing the mouse in an event handler","user":{"login":"hogoww","id":21278554,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxMjc4NTU0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/21278554?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hogoww","html_url":"https://github.com/hogoww","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hogoww/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hogoww/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hogoww/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hogoww/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hogoww/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hogoww/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hogoww/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hogoww/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hogoww/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\nWhen you [capture the mouse](https://docs.godotengine.org/en/stable/classes/class_input.html#enum-input-mousemode) in an event handler (e.g, [Node._unhandled_input()](https://docs.godotengine.org/en/stable/classes/class_node.html#class-node-private-method-unhandled-input)), the event is not passed down in the next handler (e.g, [CollisionObject3D._input_event()](https://docs.godotengine.org/en/stable/classes/class_collisionobject3d.html#class-collisionobject3d-private-method-input-event)).\r\nThat interaction is, as far as I could find at the time, undocumented.\r\n\r\n- Closes https://github.com/godotengine/godot-docs/issues/11742\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\n### Summary of changes: \r\nI tried to add a one liner to document the interaction between the [set_mouse_mode()](https://docs.godotengine.org/en/stable/classes/class_input.html#class-input-property-mouse-mode) method and event handlers on [set_mouse_mode()](https://docs.godotengine.org/en/stable/classes/class_input.html#class-input-property-mouse-mode) method, as well as what to do to avoid this interaction.\r\n\r\n### Motivation: \r\nMore details on the godot-doc [issue](https://github.com/godotengine/godot-docs/issues/11742).\r\n[Minimal Reproducible example](https://github.com/hogoww/MRE_Godot_Mouse_capture_handler) illustrating the issue.\r\n\r\n### Related work: \r\nNewbie here, I'm not following enough to know what might be related work/issues/PR.\r\nProbably not relevant AFAIK.\r\n\r\n### Technical overview: \r\nNot relevant AFAIK.\r\n\r\n### Testing: \r\nI haven't build the documentation locally to check that it works properly yet.\r\n\r\n### Discussion: \r\nIt took me a while to find that it was the case, and I tried to open an issue to discuss it, albeit without enough context retrospectively.\r\nI initially thought it might be a bug, but I think it's a feature.\r\nI'd just wish that it was documented, as it wasn't obvious to me !\r\n\r\nThis might make more sense to add elsewhere, for instance on [MouseMode.MOUSE_MODE_CAPTURED](https://docs.godotengine.org/en/stable/classes/class_input.html#class-input-property-mouse-mode).\r\nI also think it'd be worthwhile to add to [Input handling/Using InputEvent](https://docs.godotengine.org/en/stable/tutorials/inputs/index.html).\r\nLet me know if you think so too, and I'll propose something :)\r\n\r\nValid on godot 4.5 through 4.7.2, at least.\r\n\r\n(No AI was used at any point of investigating my issue, nor writing up the MRE, Issue, or PR).","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","description":"","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":283518839,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyODM1MTg4Mzk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/documentation","name":"documentation","description":"","color":"ffddff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-09-09T14:50:18Z","updated_at":"2026-09-10T18:34:05Z","closed_at":"2026-09-10T17:09:42Z","merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"4c3a216668466b8b3fb8cb2884f9cc7d8529c890","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"hogoww:master","ref":"master","repo":{"id":1362774876,"node_id":"R_kgDOUTpLXA","name":"godot","full_name":"hogoww/godot","owner":{"login":"hogoww","id":21278554,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxMjc4NTU0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/21278554?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hogoww","html_url":"https://github.com/hogoww","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hogoww/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ho